  "weekly_summary": {
    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "After a period of metagame evolution, the impact of the Zeta cards has become fairly clear. [[card:Baleful Strix|Baleful Strix]] is undoubtedly the strongest card, with Dimir Control and Dimir Faeries both now at the top of the metagame. Not every red deck plays [[card:Vandalblast|Vandalblast]], but control builds splashing red for it in the sideboard are now the most popular variants. Meanwhile, [[card:Dispatch|Dispatch]] decks have fallen somewhat behind. These decks, led by Esper Affinity, can now even be grouped under “Other.”",
          "zh": "经过一段时间的环境演变，Zeta单卡对环境的影响基本比较明确。[[card:Baleful Strix|恶邪枭]]毫无疑问是最强单卡，蓝黑控制、蓝黑仙灵现在都处于环境顶端。[[card:Vandalblast|蛮野冲击]]虽然不是所有红色套牌都带，但备牌为了[[card:Vandalblast|蛮野冲击]]混红的控制现在是最流行的版本。而[[card:Dispatch|迅速了结]]套牌相对有些掉队，以艾斯波共鸣为首的这类套牌甚至已经可以归入“其他”。"
        }
      },
