          "en": "Among the new FRA cards, [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] began appearing in Ruby Storm last week, and some Mono-Red Madness decks have started using it this week as well. A build replacing [[card:Kessig Flamebreather|Kessig Flamebreather]] with [[card:Kiln Fiend|Kiln Fiend]] made the Top 8: deck:f3bc98dff40ca00607c5, with one [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] in the sideboard. Another build, running one copy in the main deck and three in the sideboard as a resource plan after sideboarding, reached the semifinals: deck:3661808034b758be269b.",
          "zh": "FRA新牌方面，[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]在上周进入红风暴套牌之后，本周一些纯红疯魔套牌也开始使用。一套把[[card:Kessig Flamebreather|凯锡革喷焰师]]换成[[card:Kiln Fiend|火炉邪鬼]]的版本拿下一个八强：deck:f3bc98dff40ca00607c5，备牌带了一张[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]。而另一个主1备3，用它作为备牌资源计划的版本拿下一个四强：deck:3661808034b758be269b。"
